WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.164 --> 00:00:01.557
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.557 --> 00:00:02.478
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.478 --> 00:00:03.969
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.969 --> 00:00:04.970
And now, let's get to the news.

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:06.840
Former President Trump

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.541
released a letter last week,

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:10.809
urging Texas
Governor Greg Abbott

00:00:10.809 --> 00:00:14.180
to audit the results
of the 2020 election, and said,

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.683
"We're quickly running
out of time."

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:18.952
You're running out of time?

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:20.419
The election was a year ago.

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:22.321
Also, you won Texas.

00:00:22.321 --> 00:00:23.656
What are you hoping they find?

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:26.225
"Well, we reran the numbers
and this is crazy --

00:00:26.225 --> 00:00:29.428
there's like
40,000 Georgia votes here."

00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:32.065
[ Laughter ]
Former President Obama
announced on Friday

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:34.734
he will hold a groundbreaking
ceremony this week

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.302
for his presidential library.

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:39.972
Meanwhile, the Trump Library
was deleted from the Internet.

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:43.777
[ Laughter ]
88-year-old Iowa
Senator Chuck Grassley

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:46.879
announced on Friday that he will
run for reelection next year.

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:50.015
I mean, you have to appreciate
his optimism.

00:00:50.015 --> 00:00:53.920
If I was 88, I think I would
buy eggs one at a time.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.854
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.854 --> 00:00:58.524
Former New York mayoral
candidate Andrew Yang

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:00.727
will reportedly launch
a new political party

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:03.896
that he will call
The Forward Party.

00:01:03.896 --> 00:01:07.934
I always thought Republicans
were the forward party.

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:10.970
[ Laughter ]
Producers of the Netflix series
"Tiger King" announced last week

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:14.307
that the show will return later
this year for a second season.

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:16.642
"Well, that can't be good,"

00:01:16.642 --> 00:01:19.212
said Carole Baskin's
current husband.

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:20.546
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.546 --> 00:01:22.949
According to a new study,

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:24.751
using a sauna
at least twice a week

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:27.787
can have cardiovascular benefits
similar to exercise,

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:30.256
because nothing will get
your heart rate going

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:32.625
like the scary things
you'll see in there.

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:33.826
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.826 --> 00:01:36.729
Oh, very artfully done,
graphics department.

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.197
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.197 --> 00:01:40.466
A Rhode Island home
that was the inspiration

00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:42.068
for the movie and book
"The Conjuring"

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:45.705
stole -- sold recently
for $1.2 million.

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:47.907
Even more terrifying --
the list price was

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:50.543
[ Spookily ]
$900,000.

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:51.811
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:53.213
And, finally,
according to a new poll,

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:55.248
75% of Americans would call

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:57.683
the season between summer
and winter, fall,

00:01:57.683 --> 00:01:59.652
while 21% will call it autumn.

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:01.520
Of course,
Walgreens just calls it

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:02.688
Christmas.

00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:04.224
And that was a monologue.

